Description: Work with json data and convert non-json data to/from json
 JSON Toolkit is a comprehensive suite of command-line utilities for working
 with JSON and other data formats. It provides bidirectional conversion between
 JSON and CSV, XML, YAML, TOML, HTML, logfmt, and environment variables, as well
 as tools for JSON manipulation, schema generation, and database integration.
 .
 Features include:
  * Format conversion between JSON and multiple formats
  * JSON diff, formatting, and schema generation
  * Database integration (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite3)
  * Unix-friendly command-line tools that work with pipes
